@Takwene_HostAddress = https://localhost:7000

# Seeded logins: admin@takwene.com / Admin@12345
#                amr@takwene.com, cairokee@takwene.com, wegz@takwene.com / Artist@12345
# Paste the accessToken from a login response here:
@token = <accessToken>

### Login as admin
POST {{Takwene_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@takwene.com",
  "password": "Admin@12345"
}

### Login as an artist (Amr Diab)
POST {{Takwene_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "amr@takwene.com",
  "password": "Artist@12345"
}

### Who am I (roles, permissions, artist_id)
GET {{Takwene_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Refresh (rotates: the old refresh token stops working)
POST {{Takwene_HostAddress}}/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "<refreshToken>"
}

### Logout
POST {{Takwene_HostAddress}}/api/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "<refreshToken>"
}

### Create artist + login (admin). Omit "password" to get a temporary one back.
POST {{Takwene_HostAddress}}/api/artists
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sherine",
  "email": "sherine@takwene.com",
  "country": "Egypt"
}

### List artists (admin)
GET {{Takwene_HostAddress}}/api/artists?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List DSPs
GET {{Takwene_HostAddress}}/api/dsps
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List tracks (artists only ever get their own)
GET {{Takwene_HostAddress}}/api/tracks?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Filter + search (search needs 3+ characters; matches title, artist name, ISRC)
GET {{Takwene_HostAddress}}/api/tracks?genre=pop&status=Submitted&search=sah
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Search too short -> 400
GET {{Takwene_HostAddress}}/api/tracks?search=ab
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Track details (seeded "Ahla Ayam" by Amr Diab)
GET {{Takwene_HostAddress}}/api/tracks/40000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create track (artistId is required for admins, ignored for artists)
POST {{Takwene_HostAddress}}/api/tracks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Leilet El Omr",
  "isrc": "EG-TKW-26-00010",
  "genre": "Pop",
  "releaseDate": "2026-12-01",
  "artistId": "20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001"
}

### Distribute "Ya Habibi Taala" (Draft) to Spotify + YouTube -> becomes Submitted
POST {{Takwene_HostAddress}}/api/tracks/40000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003/distribute
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dspIds": [
    "30000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
    "30000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003"
  ]
}

### Admin: mark "Sahran Leh" on Spotify as Live
PATCH {{Takwene_HostAddress}}/api/tracks/40000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002/distributions/50000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000004/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Live"
}

### Mark "Sahran Leh" as Distributed (needs at least one Live distribution)
PATCH {{Takwene_HostAddress}}/api/tracks/40000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Distributed"
}
